# After the Corrupted Enforcer falls (Milestone 20d, escape start). Plays when
# the Guild reloads after the fight; then the map fades out to the overworld.

spawn frank frank at ~-1,0 facing right
face player left
emote frank note
say Frank: Ha! Down it goes! Didn't even see you move. I'm glad you're on my side.
say Frank: Listen - I heard the guards talking. They took three others like you. Souls that still shine clean, the ones the Unraveling can't turn.
say Frank: So Vorath's people lock them away instead. One is held in {next}, {next_where}.
emote player !
say Silas: Then we get them out. All three. Breaking people out of places is sort of my specialty.
say Frank: Verdance first - the village up the road from here. You need rest, and I need to see what's left of my stock. Come on - fresh air!
fade out 1
